{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Solitaire - Timeless</strong> provides 24 new decks to use with AI Solitaire! This DLC is themed around the idea that beauty is timeless and celebrates beautiful girls from the ancient past all the way into the distant future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 24 included decks are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/extras/3fa852e4b7dce64197fc841ec23f3b78.avif?t=1761373102\" width=600 height=2163 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2963380?t=1761373102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761373102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/c2d805e03deca0a0ae811881112e8fc69b9dbb99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761373102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/c2d805e03deca0a0ae811881112e8fc69b9dbb99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761373102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"The first time you run AI Solitaire you will be directed to the Parental Controls menu. There you can set the allowable content level that will be seen in the game. You may protect these settings with a password, or you can permanently change them so that they can only be changed by uninstalling and reinstalling the game.\r\n\r\nAI Solitaire is intended to be a celebration of AI Generated Art. The content of this DLC includes beautiful women rendered in a variety of artistic styles. The outfits and costumes can be revealing. Various art styles may feature exagerated proportions. Swimsuits and sexy clothing will always have a minimum of a Teen+ rating. Overly exagerated female proportions or wearing realistic lingerie will be rated Adult."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Solitaire - Timeless</strong> provides 24 new decks to use with AI Solitaire! This DLC is themed around the idea that beauty is timeless and celebrates beautiful girls from the ancient past all the way into the distant future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 24 included decks are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/extras/3fa852e4b7dce64197fc841ec23f3b78.avif?t=1761373102\" width=600 height=2163 /></span></p>","developers":["Bikini Beach Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2301670","name":"AI Solitaire"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/e5029c4a236f17568c9603ab4d27706c0823a50c/header.jpg?t=1761373102","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>AI Solitaire - Timeless is \u00a9 Copyright 2025 by Denki Gaka. All Rights Reserved.</strong><br><i>Please Note: The art for the majority of the card decks was created using Stable Diffusion, an artificial intelligence text to image generator. The main purpose in creating this product was to test the limits of what is possible using this amazing new technology. We claim copyright in the card deck images as they are presented here, but acknowledge that the artwork is not an original work made by us, but rather is the results of years of hard work by talented computer scientists, as well as decades, if not centuries, of artistic endeavor by the truly talented artists whose work was used to train the models. Acknowledgement and our thanks goes out to both groups.<br><br>Some of our decks may feature likenesses of celebrities and historical figures. None of these individuals were involved in the production of this work and we claim no endorsement from them. These images are included as parody and tribute to their genuine awesomeness. We label these decks as \"Celebritease\", with the emphasis on \"TEASE\". There are certainly similarities to the famous individuals, but we doubt that any of them would see these images and mistake them for their own reflection in a mirror.</i>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"AI Solitaire - Timeless","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Bikini Beach Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Conte\u00fado sexual\r\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"true"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Sexuelle Inhalte\nGewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"14 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/830f9d2605927add4383c6ba3ced929ccda3e930/ss_830f9d2605927add4383c6ba3ced929ccda3e930.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761373102","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/830f9d2605927add4383c6ba3ced929ccda3e930/ss_830f9d2605927add4383c6ba3ced929ccda3e930.600x338.jpg?t=1761373102"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/d655ed5da5d57509e8c644fec262599f241282f9/ss_d655ed5da5d57509e8c644fec262599f241282f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761373102","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/d655ed5da5d57509e8c644fec262599f241282f9/ss_d655ed5da5d57509e8c644fec262599f241282f9.600x338.jpg?t=1761373102"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963380/46